vk_8w3","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"劉毅","kind":"person","person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007","text":"戎在職雖無殊能，而庶績修理。後遷光祿勳、吏部尚書，以母憂去職。性至孝，不拘禮制，飲酒食肉，或觀弈棋，而容貌毀悴，杖然後起。裴頠往吊之，謂人曰：「若使一慟能傷人，濬沖不免滅性之譏也。」時和嶠亦居父喪，以禮法自持，量米而食，哀毀不逾於戎。帝謂劉毅曰：「和嶠毀頓過禮，使人憂之。」毅曰：「嶠雖寢苫食粥，乃生孝耳。至於王戎，所謂死孝，陛下當先憂之。」戎先有吐疾，居喪增甚。帝遣醫療之，並賜藥物，又斷賓客。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"s6r_kug_pk7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"裴頠","kind":"person","person_id":"svm_6fh_34r","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"濬沖","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"和嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"3fc_362_06e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"父","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"和嶠父未名，本來源尚未與其他父名交證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"劉毅","kind":"person","person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"和嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"3fc_362_06e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"毅","kind":"person","person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0141","start":141,"end":142,"surface":"嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"3fc_362_06e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"王戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0171","start":171,"end":172,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":76,"last_line":76,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015","text":"毌丘儉作亂，景帝自出征之，百官祖送於城東，袤疾病不任會。帝謂中領軍王肅曰：「唯不見鄭光祿為恨。」肅以語袤，袤自輿追帝，及於近道。帝笑曰：「故知侯生必來也。」遂與袤共載，曰：「計將何先？」袤曰：「昔與儉俱為台郎，特所知悉。其人好謀而不達事情，自昔建勳幽州，志望無限。文欽勇而無算。今大軍出其不意，江、淮之卒銳而不能固，深溝高壘以挫其氣，此亞夫之長也。」帝稱善。轉太常。高貴鄉公議立明堂辟雍，精選博士，袤舉劉毅、劉寔、程咸、庾峻，後並至公輔大位。及常道鄉公立，與議定策，進封安城鄉侯，邑千戶。景元初，疾病失明，屢乞骸骨，不許。拜光祿大夫。五等初建，封密陵伯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"毌丘儉","kind":"person","person_id":"b61_784_cbb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAH","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"王肅","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"鄭光祿","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"肅","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line01